<英文法規名稱>Regulations Governing the Application for and Payment of Long-term Care Services for Foreign Professionals and Their Dependents</英文法規名稱>
<中文法規名稱>外國專業人才及其眷屬長期照顧服務申請及給付辦法</中文法規名稱>
